    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dans un village sur les bords de la Meuse, Basile Matrin, magasinier d\u2019usine, m\u00e8ne une vie monotone aux c\u00f4t\u00e9s de son \u00e9pouse Rose. La jeune Maryse Duval, revenue de Paris, laissant son r\u00eave de com\u00e9dienne derri\u00e8re elle, va involontairement faire basculer leur destin. Leur voisin, correspondant au Quotidien de la Meuse, est t\u00e9moin du drame comique qui se joue en face de chez lui...",
        "english": "Once upon a time in a rainy country somewhere on the French-Belgian border : two friends neighbors. One lives alone with its dog Flaubert and writes insipid articles in a local newspaper. The other one, Martin, le leader storemanin a factory in \"Vallee dela Meuse\" is married to Rose, who has intention to die as late as possible as storeman'xife. They live in the same street, houses face to face.When Marise Duval begins her training in the factory, Matrin is so happy. A trip by car later, and a kill returns Matrin to the life which beats in him. Rose, to whom a 'voice' reveals the infidelity of her husband, falls in depression and Matrin, who make feel guilty make all the possible to bring back to her the happiness. But unfortunaltely all his plans will end ony in disppointements."
